WEBVTT

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.470
Here I go!

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:45.730
Perfect!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:48.980
Nice, Chise! Really good form!

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:52.320
Senpai, this is pretty easy!

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.940
It's easy, huh?

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.110
She's a quick learner.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.530
Um, I've got a question.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:00.120
What?

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:04.870
Dyna Soldier and Dyna Wing
can combine, right?

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:05.950
Yup.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:11.590
So, can't it do the same thing
with Koyomi's Dyna Striker?

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.510
Good point. Wanna try?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.550
Huh? You mean, today?

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.140
Okay! Take over, Yomo!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.850
Huh? Uh, I'm doing it?

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:27.480
Ugh. I kinda wanted to leave early...

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.690
Then hurry it up.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:48.250
Dyna Soldier Striker Combine!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.670
There. We did it.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.500
That's pretty slick!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.920
I'd call it a success!

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:58.880
Uh, careful! Whoa!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.510
That hurt.

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:06.930
Yeah. Might be a balance problem
if it can't even stand.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.930
All right! Try again!

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:12.560
Sorry, but I've gotta go soon!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:13.250
Eh?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.020
Oh. Me, too.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.940
Ah, I guess you're right.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.200
Yeah. I've got plans.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.610
Even you?

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:27.580
I told you I was taking today off!
And yet, here I am!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:31.040
What's a day off to the unemployed?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.960
Fine! That's it for today! Disperse!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.920
What's Lover-Like Mean?

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.920
Episode 5

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:44.930
Sorry. All I have is the edited version,
so it might not have what you want.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.930
[Vlog #27] Sopranos

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.720
It's okay. Thank you.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:54.230
This video isn't public. No one can see it
unless they have the link.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.520
Yeah?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:01.740
There's lots of footage of people
goofing off, so we hid it from the school.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.950
It won't show up in searches.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.410
I see.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:12.210
She's smiling a lot.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.130
Um...

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.800
What?

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.970
Is it okay for us to drink together?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.260
Huh?

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.970
Aren't you married, Inamoto?

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:32.390
I guess I am! You know,
Inamoto isn't my last name anymore.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.690
And yet, it's okay to drink with me?

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.650
Come on! Of course, it's fine!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.400
Yeah?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.870
I wonder why I got married?

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:55.120
Koyomi, you haven't told anyone
my secret, right?

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.330
I haven't.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:01.800
It'd be bad if the school
learned I broke the glass.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.840
Yeah, probably.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.680
I might get expelled.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.720
Middle schoolers can't be, right?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.310
Oh, yeah. Wanna see something neat?

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.520
Cho Jin

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.520
Public

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.520
Izakaya

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.570
Thanks for today.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.480
Mmm.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.400
Till next time! See ya!

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:32.040
C'mon, Senpai.
Forget the women of the past.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.000
Why are you here?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.460
Wanna see something neat?

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.790
Neat?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Congratulations!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Tokyo Beach Land

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Free Entry

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Free Entry

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Winner!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Winner!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.400
Winner!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:44.590
Ta-da! This girl won free tickets
to Tokyo Beach Land!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:58.400
Sizumu is the enemy, right?

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:02.940
Yeah. He is to Gauma at least.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:08.410
What's our relationship with a classmate
who's a Kaiju Eugenicist?

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.820
Relationship, huh?

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.290
Ask her out on a date.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.580
It's not that easy.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:25.670
I won tickets to Tokyo Beach Land!
Let's hit the pool this weekend!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:28.470
The pool? What do you think?

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:29.590
Hmm.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.300
Um, shouldn't we go?

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:32.030
Sounds nice.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:32.890
Huh?

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:36.270
The pool. Think I can come?

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.440
Um...

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.250
Sure.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.400
Huh?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.190
Let's all go.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.520
Thanks.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:51.450
You're right. It might be
a good chance to capture Sizumu.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.120
Yume, you're a genius!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.250
I figured we should work together.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.750
I see.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:04.170
I couldn't get him at school,
but this time, I'll nab him for sure.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.550
Captain Gauma, do you have a plan for it?

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:08.420
I do!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.380
Like?

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.550
Like...

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.930
Like?

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.600
Like this!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:22.440
But first, dinner! Eat up! You can't
do squat on an empty stomach!

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.290
"Crab-flavored Sticks"

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:25.190
--Senpai, do you have a swimsuit?
--That jerk is never gonna see it coming.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:28.070
--I have one from elementary school.
--That jerk is never gonna see it coming.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.200
Huh? Does it fit?

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:33.910
This time, I'll get him
for sure! Like, bam!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.450
Well, whatever.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.450
It fits.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.910
From elementary school?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.810
Tokyo Beach Land

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.870
It's Sunday!

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.620
And yet, it's totally dead.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.750
'Cuz it's June.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:45.040
Gauma, your face!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.930
Which arm do I wear the key on?

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:56.100
Uh, I don't think it matters.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:56.100
I'm gonna get payback, big time.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.560
Hmm. All right.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.560
I'm gonna nab you this time.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.430
Gauma, we hear you!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.270
Do you swim often?

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:07.690
Nah, I'm not that good at it.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:08.860
Mmm?

