00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:20.890
Huh?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.370
That's the opposite of natural!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.670
Don't let him see through you.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.920
R-Right.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:32.880
Good. May the operation to capture
a Kaiju Eugenicist begin!

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:41.100
Act like lovers... How?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.730
Where do we start?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:48.230
Huh? Yeah. How long should we
say we've dated for?

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.650
What?

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:53.150
Huh? Uh, never mind.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:56.200
Let's start with a small one!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.960
Unlike school, no one will
get in my way here.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:11.420
Prepare yourself, Sizumu! Here I come--!

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.970
No running by the pool!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:19.180
Huh? Eating already?

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.390
I didn't have breakfast.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.360
Churro?

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.490
The sugar's getting everywhere.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:40.620
Is it good?

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.540
Mmm.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:52.090
Oh, Sizumu. Huh? Where's Gauma?

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.090
Getting yelled at for running.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.220
That's embarrassing.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:59.930
Go ahead, you two. Don't wait on me.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.760
Huh?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.680
Let's go, Yomogi.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:07.690
Yeah, sure... Uh...

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.480
Wanna do that?

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.440
Mmm.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.360
It looks empty. C'mon.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.380
Oh, wait.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.650
Huh?

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.700
You shouldn't run.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.620
Good point. Don't wanna get yelled at.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.050
Look! Inner tubes!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.920
Yeah, let's.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.990
Those two are hitting it off.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:00.160
Sure are. Say, where's Gauma?

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:05.330
Uh... I wonder if his strategy succeeded?

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:10.290
Look at you, lounging around.
I'm so gonna capture you!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.130
Just as planned, I'm gonna--

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.300
No jumping, please!

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:23.550
Dammit, Sizumu! Screw you!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.220
You okay?

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:30.440
Don't worry. The operation
is just getting started.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:33.060
You look a little beat up.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.940
Wanna relax in the onsen?

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:40.700
--Hey! Quit shaking it!
--Whoa! I almost fell!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.160
Can you make it?

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.990
Yeah, probably.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.840
--Don't knock me off, jeez!
--Sorry, my bad!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.840
Minami?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:04.220
Sorry, I'm heading back.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:05.140
Huh?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:26.740
Sorry. Did I tire you out from
running around too much?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.370
No, it's not your fault.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:36.750
By the way, I wonder how
Gauma's strategy is going.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.000
Strategy?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:38.920
Huh?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:45.430
All right, that's better. I'm revived.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:47.180
This time, I'll--

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:56.060
This guy isn't built very strong.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.820
Uh, I said "strategy," but...

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:06.450
I mean, like, an "everyone-get-along
strategy" or something...

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:12.120
Yeah, you know?
Sorry. Forget I said anything.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.460
Are you two dating?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:18.500
Huh? Um, us... dating?

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:23.380
People like to give themselves
purpose like that.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.050
Purpose?

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:29.890
They seek freedom while also
constraining themselves.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:35.310
They influence others while being
influenced themselves. Isn't that sad?

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:38.860
I wouldn't say I feel constrained.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:43.440
That's only because you guys
can't see your own prisons.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:44.860
Right.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:47.360
Why did you approach us?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:50.200
Like I said before, I was curious.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.540
Because we pilot Dynazenon?

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:57.120
There's that, but I felt
emotions from you.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.630
Emotions?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:02.550
Emotions are a <i>kaiju</i>'s favorite thing.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.720
<i>Kaiju </i>have favorites?

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.890
Ah! There you are!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.140
You're up, Sizumu!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.060
Well, see you later.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:18.730
We're leaving already? We just got here.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:22.570
Are you kidding me?
We're about to wreck shit up!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.990
Can we come back after?!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:28.200
You're welcome to.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.990
What was that about?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:36.870
Yomogi! Were they just here?!

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.880
Yeah. They left pretty quickly.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:44.250
I wonder if they won tickets, too?

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:48.340
<i>Kaiju?!</i>

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:59.190
What is that thing? So creepy.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.900
Well, Sizumu?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.820
Yeah. It's not bad.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.740
Instance Domination.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:14.490
Hurry up, but don't run!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:19.290
There's no time to change!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:22.500
Access Mode... Dyna Soldier!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.380
Dyna Wing!

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.460
Dyna Striker!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.550
Dyna Diver!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.600
Oh. I left Chise behind.

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.480
Huh?! Chise?!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:42.940
I kinda climbed aboard out of habit.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.520
Oh. Out of habit, huh?

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.570
They got here quick.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:54.280
Let's combine and wrap this up!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.800
Not on my watch.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.810
C'mon! Hey!

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:21.100
Quit picking on Yume!

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.860
Argh, shit!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.950
Minami!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.120
If only I could attack from afar!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:44.170
Oh, Koyomi! Let's try that thing!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.210
Huh? Are you sure?

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:47.790
--Please!
--Senpai!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.260
All right!

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.080
Dyna Soldier Striker Combine!

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:28.340
You can do it, Yomogi!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:31.380
Hang in there, Dyna Soldier!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.300
Striker Storm Alpha!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.720
Striker Storm Beta!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.640
Fire!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.030
--Ouch!
--Ow, ow, ow!

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:56.030
All right! Time to combine!

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.950
Combine Dragon Dynazenon!

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:44.290
There's Dynazenon! Crush 'em, Sizumu!

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.330
Dynazenon...

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.000
...Battle, Go!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:14.230
Hey, hey, hey! The hell is this thing?!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.150
Disperse!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:20.450
What?!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:40.970
Super Dragon Dyna Rex!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.220
Blazing Inferno...

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:51.190
...Rex Roar!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.080
I lost.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.700
Can we go back?!

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.950
Uh, sure.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.580
Aren't you guys pissed?!

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.500
Gauma may have won again,

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:19.720
but next time, we're gonna whoop his a--

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:30.600
I wanted to swim more!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:34.270
Sizumu's gonna get it next time.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:34.270
We've gotta go back and get our stuff.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.940
Oh! We can swim more while we're there!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:39.990
My strategy was too sloppy.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:37.820
I've had enough.

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.990
Aww!

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:44.360
Thanks for back there.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.280
Huh?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:21:00.760
No jumping, please!

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:06.640
It's freezing!

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.810
Minami! You, too!

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.690
Aww!

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:25.490
