put you in touch?

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.490
Tokyo Beach Land

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.450
The onsen, at last!

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:37.290
I thought I was dead.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:43.800
I heard from Urita that you
want to know about Kano?

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:50.010
Yes. I'm curious about what happened
before her accident.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:52.470
About that...

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.600
What is it?

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:58.690
It's hard to say in front of
her little sister.

00:21:58.690 --> 00:22:02.320
Don't worry about it.
It's been five years.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:04.740
I see.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:07.570
If you know something, please say.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:10.910
It's just a rumor I heard
back then, but...

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.290
Yeah?

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:17.000
It wasn't an accident, but suici--
